{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（19日）上午11時許，尖沙嘴梳士巴利道香港文化中心發生火警，消防接報到場，約15分鐘將火救熄。</p><p>一名女工作人員面及手部燒傷，救護員為她敷上急救敷料，送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:39:46.671555+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:15:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T05:57:40.615646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:38:05.593251+00:00","content_hash":"8fa509adccbc492c10bdeb43756599e8ee7f0cae3f7a5c3a6b0f09da3d740bec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}